# ratchet — Zero Architectural Regression (Anti-Drift)

Module: github.com/fow830/ratchet
Preset: 
Profile: standard

## Absolute Guardrails
1. Pure Go SSOT in ratchet.json (+ optional Go codegen: sqlc/buf/oapi via profiles).
2. NO Go .so plugins — use WebAssembly (wazero) rule packs.
3. No academic formal-verifier translators (TLA+, Lean4) in core.
4. Validate with go/ast, PBT, testcontainers, race/fuzz/mutation gates.

## Layer Edges
- delivery → domain, usecase
- domain → (none; leaf)
- usecase → domain

## Agent Protocol (RED→GREEN)
1. Write or extend a failing contract in tests/contracts/ first (RED).
2. Implement the minimal fix (GREEN).
3. Run `ratchet check --format=llm` and fix every RULE_VIOLATION.
4. Run `ratchet gen` / `ratchet lock` before committing contract/SSOT changes.
5. When contracts change, include LRT-VERIFY in the commit message.
